#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md:688
msgid "options.bash"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md:690
msgid ""
"Enabled by default, this option enforces bash-like behavior with stars "
"immediately following a bracket expression. Bash bracket expressions are "
"similar to regex character classes, but unlike regex, a star following a "
"bracket expression **does not repeat the bracketed characters**. Instead,"
" the star is treated the same as an other star."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md:694 ../../source/nanomatch_README.md:968
msgid "Default: `true`"
msgstr ""

