#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md:982
msgid "Features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md:984
msgid ""
"Nanomatch has full support for standard Bash glob features, including the"
" following \"metacharacters\": `*`, `**`, `?` and `[...]`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md:986
msgid "Here are some examples of how they work:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md
msgid "**Pattern**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md
msgid "**Description**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md
msgid "`*`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md
msgid "Matches any string except for `/`, leading `.`, or `/.` inside a path"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md
msgid "`**`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md
msgid ""
"Matches any string including `/`, but not a leading `.` or `/.` inside a "
"path. More than two stars (e.g. `***` is treated the same as one star, "
"and `**` loses its special meaning"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md
msgid "`foo*`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md
msgid "Matches any string beginning with `foo`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md
msgid "`*bar*`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md
msgid "Matches any string containing `bar` (beginning, middle or end)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md
msgid "`*.min.js`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md
msgid "Matches any string ending with `.min.js`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md
msgid "`[abc]*.js`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md
msgid "Matches any string beginning with `a`, `b`, or `c` and ending with `.js`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md
msgid "`abc?`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md
msgid "Matches `abcd` or `abcz` but not `abcde`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md:998
msgid "The exceptions noted for `*` apply to all patterns that contain a `*`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md:1000
msgid "**Not supported**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md:1002
msgid "The following extended-globbing features are not supported:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md:1004
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"[brace expansion](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/braces) (e.g. "
"`{a,b,c}`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md:1005
msgid "[extglobs](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/extglob) (e.g. `@(a|!(c|d))`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md:1006
msgid ""
"[POSIX brackets](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/expand-brackets) (e.g. "
"`[[:alpha:][:digit:]]`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/nanomatch_README.md:1008
msgid ""
"If you need any of these features consider using "
"[micromatch](https://github.com/micromatch/micromatch) instead."
msgstr ""

